{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o055a","title":"贾诩孝廉为郎病归遇氐假称段颎外孙获免","accounts":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o055a-account","label":"《荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十》正文","text":"贾诩孝廉为郎病归遇氐假称段颎外孙获免","evidence":["xunyu-e-o055a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0182","role":"入仕脱险","evidence":["xunyu-e-o055a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"贾诩早年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["xunyu-e-o055a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"xunyu-e-o055a-q","source_order":[10,267,"O055a"],"order":2505}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0182","name":"贾诩","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xunyu-e-o055a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-cf1b01c22cd90a0fa4fb","layer":"original","quote":"察孝廉，为郎，疾病去官。西还至汧，道遇叛氐，同行数十人皆为所执。诩曰：“我段公外孙也，汝别埋我〖3〗；我家必厚赎之！”时太尉段颎〖4〗，昔久为边将，威震西土〖5〗。故诩假以惧氐〖6〗，氐果不敢害；与盟而送之。其余悉死。诩实非段甥；权以济事，咸此类也。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
